cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "denovo-kemp: purely de novo Kemp eliminase design with steered sequence sampling and replication"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "denovo-kemp contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/chr13b/denovo-kemp"
license: MIT
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-23"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible in-silico pipeline for purely de novo Kemp eliminase design: RFdiffusion3
  motif scaffolding, steered LigandMPNN inverse folding and Boltz-2 cofolding, scored on
  crystal-derived catalytic geometry, with five-seed and held-out-seed replication and a
  structural-novelty gate.
keywords:
  - protein design
  - de novo enzyme design
  - Kemp eliminase
  - RFdiffusion
  - LigandMPNN
  - Boltz-2
